  "COMPUTATIONAL efficiency only. No power or energy measurement exists anywhere in this project.",
  "E7b (otter155) and E9 (otter159) are separate measurement groups and are never merged: the fusion bridge control failed its pre-registered 10 per cent tolerance at -18.69 per cent and no adjustment factor is applied.",
  "Only END_TO_END_SERIAL rows support an end-to-end latency claim. E7a's additive sums are superseded and appear here only as a recorded supersession.",
